    "title": "Truth Ocean Sprinter 7510 - standard black model",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Challenging large GTs hidden in shallow, torrent areas</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A short length setting that makes it easier for anglers to apply high loads and even endure the intense follow from boats on unstable decks.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Rod power that anglers of average physique (physical strength) can master with effort.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot; Length: 7ft5inch</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot; Closed Length: 155.5㎝</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot; Weight: 395g ( #1 : 173g #2 : 222g )</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot; Tip Dia.: 3.6mm</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot; Butt Dia: 12.0mm</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot; Pe: Pe8-10</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot; Lure: 100-250g</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot; Pieces: 2</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">&middot; Guide: All stainless, PMNST16 / PMNSG16 / PMNSG20 / PMNSG25 / PMNSG30 / PMNSG40</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Made in Japan</strong></p>",
